Design a complete, modern, highly intuitive \*\*Cooperative Savings & Loan Management Dashboard\*\* for a Nigerian cooperative organization.

This should be a \*\*high-fidelity, presentation-ready Figma prototype\*\* with both an \*\*Admin Dashboard\*\* and a \*\*Member Dashboard\*\*.

The system manages:

\* Member registration
\* Savings
\* Loans
\* Loan applications
\* Guarantors
\* Loan repayments
\* Payment verification
\* Receipts
\* Member records
\* Notifications
\* Transaction history
\* Administrative approvals

The primary users may include adults between approximately \*\*40 and 70 years old\*\*, so the product must be extremely simple, readable, trustworthy and easy to understand. However, it should still look polished and modern enough to impress during a professional product presentation.

The central design principle is:

\*\*“Make every member understand exactly where their money is and make every administrator understand exactly what is happening.”\*\*

---

# 1. DESIGN PRINCIPLES

Prioritize:

\* Simplicity
\* Transparency
\* Trust
\* Ease of use
\* Large readable typography
\* Clear financial information
\* Minimal steps
\* Obvious actions
\* Strong visual hierarchy
\* Large clickable areas
\* Simple language
\* Clear status indicators
\* Consistent navigation
\* Responsive layouts

Avoid:

\* Overly complicated fintech interfaces
\* Tiny text
\* Crowded dashboards
\* Excessive animations
\* Excessive gradients
\* Excessive colors
\* Complicated charts
\* Hidden actions
\* Technical financial terminology
\* Unnecessary navigation items

The design should feel like a \*\*simple, trustworthy cooperative financial system\*\*, not a complicated banking application.

