# 50. MOST IMPORTANT PRODUCT FEATURES TO EMPHASIZE

Give strong visual emphasis to these five ideas:

### 1. SAVINGS TRANSPARENCY

Members can always see exactly how much they have saved and every contribution they've made.

### 2. LOAN TRANSPARENCY

Members can see exactly how much they borrowed, how much they've repaid and how much remains.

### 3. GUARANTOR WORKFLOW

Loan applications require two cooperative members to approve their guarantor requests before the application reaches the administrator.

### 4. PAYMENT VERIFICATION

Members upload receipts and administrators verify the actual transfer before balances are updated.

### 5. ONE TRANSFER, MULTIPLE ALLOCATIONS

A member can make one ₦100,000 transfer and allocate it between savings and loan repayment without paying bank charges twice.

This fifth feature should be one of the strongest visual moments in the prototype.

